*  Advanced cyber offense and defense;
*  Bioengineering;
*  Chemical synthesis;
*  Large-scale financial trading;
*  Intelligence analysis;
*  Military planning;
*  Critical infrastructure;
*  Automated vulnerability discovery;
*  High-level scientific reasoning;
...it will be subject to rate limiting, capability downgrading, mandatory human review, restriction to certified institutions, or even direct state takeover.
