This is the "tittytainment" (mindless entertainment) category you mentioned:
*  Chat companions;
*  Drafting short essays or posts;
*  Video creation;
*  Meme generation;
*  Marketing copy generation;
*  General knowledge Q&A;
*  Lifestyle assistants.
These are useful, but they do not provide genuine strategic-level capabilities.

