*  Model capability levels;
*  Inference computing power;
*  Tool permissions;
*  Duration of automation;
*  Network access;
*  Code execution;
*  Biological/chemical databases;
*  Financial transaction privileges;
*  User identity and nationality;
*  Data retention and auditing.
The recent requirement for Anthropic to restrict access by foreign nationals essentially marks a move in this direction.

